    "sections": {
        "description": "An images-first grid theme for photographers, designers and anyone with a visual archive. Pinbin puts a fluid masonry grid on the front page, with a translucent category ribbon riding the edge of each image. Version 2.0 is a ground-up rebuild: no jQuery, a CSS-native grid, full block editor support, dark mode and an accessible navigation."
